      "title": "Image: text to image with Z-Image Turbo",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Image: text to image with Z-Image Turbo\n\nMakes up to 4 images from a prompt with Z-Image Turbo in 8 steps. Built from Comfy's template image_z_image_turbo.\n\n## Models\n\n- [z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors): Z-Image Turbo, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Tongyi-MAI/Z-Image-Turbo).\n- [ae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/vae/ae.safetensors): Z-Image VAE, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Tongyi-MAI/Z-Image-Turbo).\n- [qwen_3_4b.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors): Qwen3 4B text encoder, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-4B).\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
      ],
